    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "I have thin bones, for about ten years. I've been reading about it online and it worried me. I've had arthritis in my knees for nearly five years now. I've been putting this off for weeks.",
